      <tr>
        <td id="L73" class="blob-num js-line-number" data-line-number="73"></td>
        <td id="LC73" class="blob-code blob-code-inner js-file-line">What is the variance of the number of policies that will pay out before the insured parties have reached age 61?</td>
      </tr>
